# OpenStreetMap — free Nominatim (name search) + Overpass (nearby)
# No API key is required. The static site calls these public endpoints directly.
# Follow usage policies:
# - Nominatim: https://operations.osmfoundation.org/policies/nominatim/
# - Keep request volume modest (about 1 req/sec for public Nominatim).
#
# Optional public endpoint overrides (defaults work for local/dev and Pages):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_OSM_NOMINATIM_URL=https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org/search
# NEXT_PUBLIC_OSM_OVERPASS_URL=https://overpass-api.de/api/interpreter
